- D. J. Amit, H. Gutfreund, H. Sompolinsky (1985). *Storing infinite numbers of patterns in a spin-glass model of neural networks*. Physical Review Letters 55, 1530.
- J. Hertz, A. Krogh, R. G. Palmer (1991). *Introduction to the Theory of Neural Computation*. Addison-Wesley.
- D. Krotov, J. J. Hopfield (2016). *Dense Associative Memory for Pattern Recognition*. NeurIPS. [arXiv:1606.01164](https://arxiv.org/abs/1606.01164)
- M. Demircigil, J. Heusel, M. Löwe, S. Upgang, F. Vermet (2017). *On a model of associative memory with huge storage capacity*. J. Stat. Phys. 168, 288--299. [arXiv:1702.01929](https://arxiv.org/abs/1702.01929)
- H. Ramsauer et al. (2020). *Hopfield Networks is All You Need*. [arXiv:2008.02217](https://arxiv.org/abs/2008.02217)
